Z||000000||MikeSchaefer||09-14-2001||12:49 AM||||Hi Guys, I have a new project for the next couple of weeks; A charity Rock show.  I would love to see some of you central IL guys there!  Here is my press release.<P><B>"Rock Saves"</B> Disaster Relief Rock Festival<BR>    Saturday, Sept 29th<BR>    El Paso, il; exact location TBA<P>Rock show, 100% of proceeds donated to Red Cross; Disaster Relief Fund<BR>Blood Mobile Pending<BR>Show is scheduled to begin at 5:00 PM, but depending on how many bands will participate it could begin earlier.  I am seeking local rock bands with original music, and asking them to contact me for scheduling.  I know of many bands that will agree to play, but won't start compiling an official list until Saturday.  My band: Soulshadow will be making our public debut at the show.  I'm not looking for any Christian rock, cover bands, thrash or rap.<P>$2 Suggested donation admission<BR>By helping us out, you are doing a very noble thing for the thousands of traumatized families in NY and across the states.  This will also be a bold statement for local rock, to start giving back to the people that have put us where we are today.  Please contact me for any details that you need and ways that I can assist you.  Thank you very much,<BR>Michael Schaefer<BR>309-287-1223<BR>sheilaridez@hotmail.com<BR>------------------<BR><A HREF="http://surf.to/fiero" TARGET=_blank>http://surf.to/fiero</A><BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/cheer_1.jpg"> <p>[This message has been edited by MikeSchaefer (edited 09-14-2001).]||||reg||14
